{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16110370","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16110370","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1611037001:0":{"text":"둘의 대화가 썩 유쾌하지는 않았던 모양이네요. 그로웬, 심문소로 돌아갈 시간입니다. 당신은 아직 구금 중이니까요.","source_cn":"看来你们的谈话不是很愉快……格墨文，该回审查所了，你依...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D7FEF6CE426AC1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1611037002:0":{"text":"네. 하지만 저를 오래 붙잡아둘 수는 없을 겁니다, 이브 특사님.","source_cn":"确实如此，但你没法关押我太久，伊芙特使。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD39F1DEF395F10AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1611037003:0":{"text":"그건 당신이 정할 일이 아닙니다.","source_cn":"这可不由你说了算。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3849F98180650300","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1611037004:0":{"text":"그래요, 하지만 특사님도 정할 수 없겠죠?","source_cn":"是啊，但也不由你说了算。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2422865915F8893","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:伊芙":{"text":"이브","source":"伊芙","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格墨文":{"text":"그로웬","source":"格墨文","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}